d serves more than 400 registered student organizations.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/eventservices/russel-h-kirkhof-center-4","source_title":"Russel H. Kirkhof Center - Kirkhof Center Operations and Event Services","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-22","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Informal and reservable areas have different conditions; check current building hours and reserve designated rooms through Event Services when required.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-arboretum","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"GVSU Arboretum","title":"Follow the Arboretum’s Loop for an Outdoor Reset","subtitle":"A landscaped campus path near Au Sable Hall","notes":"Enter through the flower-covered archway, follow the circulating path, and choose only established open areas for a brief break or quiet study.","short_summary":"A recognizable campus green space where students can walk, pause, or spend time outdoors between classes.","evidence_claim":"GVSU Student Life describes entering the Arboretum through its flower-covered archway, walking the path around it, and encountering students hammocking there.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/studentlife/weekly/choose-your-own-adventure-find-louie-160.htm","source_title":"Choose Your Own Adventure: Find Louie! - Student Life Weekly","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use established paths and open areas, observe posted campus rules, and avoid attaching hammocks where restrictions or tree-protection guidance prohibit it.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-ravines-natural-area-trails","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Ravines Natural Area Trails","title":"Take an Established Trail Through the Ravines","subtitle":"Campus nature trails extending along the Allendale ravines","notes":"Choose an established access point near the Arboretum or South Apartments, stay on marked routes, and allow enough daylight for the return walk.","short_summary":"A campus-spanning trail network that offers students a longer outdoor break beside the ravine landscape.","evidence_claim":"GVSU Student Life says the Ravines extend north to south across the Allendale campus and have trails accessible from points including the Arboretum and South Apartments.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/studentlife/weekly/take-a-hike-to-these-4-gorgeous-hiking-trails-201.htm","source_title":"Take a Hike to these 4 Gorgeous Hiking Trails - Student Life Weekly","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2021-11-04","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Stay on established trails, use daylight and weather-appropriate precautions, and contact GVSU Facilities regarding trail-maintenance concerns.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-climbing-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"GVSU Climbing Center","title":"Try a Drop-In Session at the Climbing Center","subtitle":"Top-rope, bouldering, and Kilter Board climbing in Finkelstein Athletic Village","notes":"Create an account and complete the appropriate waiver before arriving, then ask staff for the required orientation and properly fitted rental equipment.","short_summary":"A supervised indoor climbing space where students can share routes across several climbing formats.","evidence_claim":"GVSU documents a 26.5-foot wall with ten top-rope stations, lead lines, bouldering, and an adjustable Kilter Board, with open climbing available to the GVSU community and public.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/outdoors/climbing-center-44","source_title":"Climbing Center - Recreation & Wellness | Outdoor Adventures","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at